    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to enter the arena of <i>SteelSilk Championship</i>, a fast-paced roguelite action game playable solo or in local co-op! Control a heavily armed robotic spider with futuristic back-mounted rifles and face increasingly deadly hordes of insects. Fight to survive, unlock new arenas, and upgrade your character with procedural enhancements that make each run unique. Team up with a friend or take on the challenge alone\u2014every match is different, and every choice matters. Do you have the steel nerves and silk threads to survive the championship?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to enter the arena of <i>SteelSilk Championship</i>, a fast-paced roguelite action game playable solo or in local co-op! Control a heavily armed robotic spider with futuristic back-mounted rifles and face increasingly deadly hordes of insects. Fight to survive, unlock new arenas, and upgrade your character with procedural enhancements that make each run unique. Team up with a friend or take on the challenge alone\u2014every match is different, and every choice matters. Do you have the steel nerves and silk threads to survive the championship?</p>",
    "short_description": "Take control of a deadly robotic spider in this fast-paced roguelite shooter. Battle endless swarms of insects, unlock increasingly intense arenas, and power up with procedural upgrades\u2014play solo or in thrilling local co-op!",
